Here is a professional HTML portfolio page with a clean, light theme:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>__TOPIC__ - Portfolio</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; background: #fafafa; color: #1a1a2e; line-height: 1.6; }
        .container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

        /* Navigation */
        nav { background: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 18px 0; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
        nav .container { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        nav .logo { font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: 700; color: #0d9488; text-decoration: none; }
        nav ul { list-style: none; display: flex; gap: 28px; }
        nav a { color: #475569; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.95em; transition: color 0.2s; }
        nav a:hover { color: #0d9488; }

        /* Hero */
        .hero { text-align: center; padding: 80px 0 60px; }
        .hero h1 { font-size: 3em; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 700; }
        .hero p { font-size: 1.2em; color: #64748b; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 32px; }
        .hero .cta { display: inline-block; padding: 14px 36px; background: #0d9488; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; transition: background 0.2s; }
        .hero .cta:hover { background: #0f766e; }

        /* Portfolio Grid */
        .section { padding: 60px 0; }
        .section h2 { font-size: 2em; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 40px; text-align: center; }
        .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; }
        .card { background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s; }
        .card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
        .card h3 { color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.2em; }
        .card p { color: #64748b; font-size: 0.95em; }
        .card .tag { display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; background: #f1f5f9; color: #475569; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.8em; margin-top: 12px; }

        /* About */
        .about { background: #ffffff; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
        .about-content { max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
        .about-content p { color: #475569; font-size: 1.05em; margin-bottom: 16px; }

        /* Contact */
        .contact-form { max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .contact-form input, .contact-form textarea { width: 100%; padding: 12px 16px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 1em; margin-bottom: 16px; background: #ffffff; color: #0f172a; }
        .contact-form button { padding: 14px 36px; background: #0d9488; color: white; border: none; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; width: 100%; transition: background 0.2s; }
        .contact-form button:hover { background: #0f766e; }

        /* Footer */
        footer { text-align: center; padding: 32px 0; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.9em; }

        @media (max-width: 768px) { .hero h1 { font-size: 2em; } nav ul { gap: 16px; } .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav>
        <div class="container">
            <a href="#" class="logo">__TOPIC__</a>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#work">Work</a></li>
                <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>Hi, I'm __TOPIC__</h1>
            <p>I create beautiful digital experiences with a focus on design and functionality.</p>
            <a href="#work" class="cta">View My Work</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="work" class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>My Work</h2>
            <div class="grid">
                <div class="card"><h3>Project One</h3><p>A modern web application built with React and Node.js.</p><span class="tag">Web App</span></div>
                <div class="card"><h3>Project Two</h3><p>An e-commerce platform with a focus on user experience.</p><span class="tag">E-Commerce</span></div>
                <div class="card"><h3>Project Three</h3><p>A mobile-first dashboard with real-time data visualization.</p><span class="tag">Dashboard</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about" class="section about">
        <div class="container about-content">
            <h2>About Me</h2>
            <p>I'm a passionate designer and developer with over a decade of experience creating digital products that make a difference.</p>
            <p>I specialize in front-end development, UI/UX design, and building scalable web applications.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Get In Touch</h2>
            <form class="contact-form">
                <input type="text" placeholder="Your Name" required>
                <input type="email" placeholder="Your Email" required>
                <textarea rows="4" placeholder="Your Message" required></textarea>
                <button type="submit">Send Message</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2025 __TOPIC__. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
